<?svml using="@hypit/markup@1"?>
<svml>
  <import as="media" from="@hypit/media@1"/>
  <import as="text" from="@hypit/text@1"/>
  <import as="seedance" from="@hypit/seedance@1"/>

  <media:Video id="source" src="../../../DN0PIfW2j9k_h264.mp4"/>

  <text:Value id="direction">
    Edit this video. Keep the camera position, framing, sunset light, clay court, sea, palm trees,
    fence, the white "THERAPY." text at the top, the ball and every movement and swing exactly as
    they are. Change only the two players.

    The foreground player seen from behind becomes a young woman, still seen from behind with the
    same footwork, stance and racket swings. She has a slim athletic build, long dark hair in a
    high ponytail coming out of the back of a white cap, a fitted navy tennis top, a white pleated
    tennis skirt, white socks and white-and-red tennis shoes. Her bare arms and legs move exactly
    where the original player's arms and legs move.

    The player at the far baseline becomes a beautiful young East Asian woman with long black hair
    in a ponytail, wearing a white tennis dress, playing the same rally from the same spot. She
    stays small in the distance, as in the original.
  </text:Value>

  <seedance:ReferenceVideo id="edit" model="2.5" prompt={direction}
    duration="-1" aspect-ratio="adaptive" resolution="480p">
    <seedance:Reference video={source} person-reference="true"/>
  </seedance:ReferenceVideo>
</svml>
